== Summary
This chapter establishes the academic and theoretical foundation for the research. It details the systematic literature selection strategy, traces the evolution of fire sensing technology, and explains the core principles of Edge Intelligence and multi-modal sensor fusion. The following chapter will introduce the research context and objectives in detail.
